{{!-- The catch on the sheet's arrangement (#54).

      "Having a lock … to prevent accidental moving of these sections would
      probably be wise." It is, so the sheet arrives locked and the move arrows
      are not drawn at all until somebody asks for them.

      A word rather than a padlock glyph. Nothing else in this system ships an
      icon font — the row arrows are literal ▲▼ — and a lone padlock would have
      to be guessed at. "Arrange" also does the other half of the job: it is the
      only thing on the sheet that says the sections CAN be moved, which a
      hidden control cannot say for itself.

      The label and tooltip are swapped to "Done" by `applyLayout` when the
      sheet is unlocked. Rendered here in the locked wording because locked is
      the state every sheet starts in. --}}
<div class="la-layout">
  <button type="button" class="la-layout__toggle" data-action="toggleLayoutLock"
          data-tooltip="{{localize 'LASTARC.Tooltip.Arrange'}}">{{localize "LASTARC.Layout.Arrange"}}</button>
  <button type="button" class="la-layout__reset" data-action="resetLayout"
          data-tooltip="{{localize 'LASTARC.Tooltip.ResetLayout'}}">{{localize "LASTARC.Layout.Reset"}}</button>

  {{!-- Saved arrangements (#93): "make my own tabs/folders to swap between
        when we're in combat or out of combat".

        The PICKER stays available while the sheet is locked, because swapping
        is the thing being asked for and it is not an accident waiting to
        happen — it applies an arrangement the reader built and named. Saving
        and deleting live behind Arrange with the move arrows, since those are
        the gestures that change what is stored.

        Filled by `paintProfiles` rather than from the context: nothing here
        re-renders, and re-rendering to redraw a select would throw away the
        scroll position #55 asked to keep. Hidden until the first one is saved. --}}
  <span class="la-layout__profiles" hidden>
    <select class="la-layout__profile" data-action="switchLayoutProfile"
            data-tooltip="{{localize 'LASTARC.Tooltip.SwitchProfile'}}"
            aria-label="{{localize 'LASTARC.Layout.Profiles'}}"></select>
  </span>
  <button type="button" class="la-layout__save" data-action="saveLayoutProfile"
          data-tooltip="{{localize 'LASTARC.Tooltip.SaveProfile'}}">{{localize "LASTARC.Layout.SaveProfile"}}</button>
  <button type="button" class="la-layout__delete" data-action="deleteLayoutProfile"
          data-tooltip="{{localize 'LASTARC.Tooltip.DeleteProfile'}}">{{localize "LASTARC.Layout.DeleteProfile"}}</button>
</div>
